It is the current longest running scripted non-animated U.S. primetime TV series since the cancellation of the original Law & Order on May 24 , 2010 and is the fourth - longest running scripted U.S. primetime TV series on a major broadcast network . Law & Order : Special Victims Unit originally centered almost exclusively on the detectives of the Special Victims Unit in a fictional version of the 16th Precinct of the New York City Police Department . As the series progressed , additional supporting characters were added as allies of the detectives in the New York County Manhattan District Attorney 's office ( known as advisers from the Sex Crimes Bureau ) and the Medical Examiner 's office . Certain episodes will go into detail about detectives ' personal lives and how they may or may not tie into the crimes dealt with during the show . Typical episodes follow the detectives and their colleagues as they investigate and prosecute sexually based offenses , child abuse , and crimes against the elderly . The show starred Christopher Meloni as Detective Elliot Stabler and Mariska Hargitay as Detective Olivia Benson for its first twelve seasons until the former left the cast , unable to come to an agreement on his contract .","entities":["cancellation of the original Law & Order","16th Precinct","New York County Manhattan District Attorney's office","Sex Crimes Bureau","Medical Examiner's office","Detective Elliot Stabler","Detective Olivia Benson","child abuse","crimes against the elderly","Christopher Meloni","New York City Police Department","sexually based offenses","Special Victims Unit","Mariska Hargitay","New York City"],"facts":["Christopher Meloni -RELATED_TO-> Outstanding Lead Actor in a Drama Series","Warren Leight -RELATED_TO-> Christopher Meloni","child abuse -PART_OF-> Abuse","Christopher Meloni -RELATED_TO-> Elliot Stabler","Wolf -RELATED_TO-> Christopher Meloni"]}
