According to Brown , another song was going to be used in the album , however , he was asked so much about `` What Ifs '' on social media that it was then decided that the song should be included in the album . Composition ( edit ) The song is in the key of G minor with a moderately fast tempo of approximately 126 beats per minute . It follows the chord progression Gm - B ♭ - F. Brown 's vocals range from F - B ♭ . Commercial performance ( edit ) The song sold 6,000 downloads in the US the week the album was released on December 2 , 2016 , allowing it to chart at number 37 on the US Billboard Hot Country Songs chart . The song first entered the US Billboard Country Airplay chart for the week of March 4 , 2017 at number 60 . It reached No. 1 on Hot Country Songs in October 2017 , ending the record breaking 34 - week reign of Sam Hunt 's `` Body Like a Back Road '' . The song is the first No. 1 on the chart for both Brown and Alaina .","entities":["What Ifs","Alaina","Body Like a Back Road","US Billboard Hot Country Songs chart","US Billboard Country Airplay chart","Sam Hunt","Brown"],"facts":["What Ifs -RELATED_TO-> Country Streaming Songs","What Ifs -RELATED_TO-> RCA Nashville","What Ifs -RELATED_TO-> Music Canada","What Ifs -RELATED_TO-> United States","What Ifs -RELATED_TO-> five main country charts"]}
