You normally think of order , and structure , and full commitment and no hesitation ... he 's just a little bit more unpolished . It 's in his costume , in his lightsaber -- how you kind of get the sense that it could just not work at any moment ; that it could just blow up . That 's kind of like a big metaphor for him . Appearances ( edit ) Model of Kylo 's cross-bladed lightsaber on display at Star Wars Launch Bay at Disney 's Hollywood Studios ( 2015 ) . Feature films ( edit ) The Force Awakens ( 2015 ) ( edit ) Main article : Star Wars : The Force Awakens Kylo Ren first appears in The Force Awakens as the commander of the First Order , a sinister regime that has risen from the remains of the old Galactic Empire . After arriving at Jakku to retrieve a map containing the coordinates for the location of Luke Skywalker , Ren kills an old vicar known as Lor San Tekka and captures Resistance pilot Poe Dameron , who has also been sent to recover the map by General Leia Organa .","entities":["Kylo Ren","Leia Organa","Luke Skywalker","First Order","Galactic Empire","The Force Awakens","Poe Dameron","map","cross-bladed lightsaber","model of Kylo's cross-bladed lightsaber","Star Wars Launch Bay","Jakku","Resistance","Lor San Tekka","Disney's Hollywood Studios"],"facts":["Kylo Ren -RELATED_TO-> Padmé Amidala","Kylo Ren -RELATED_TO-> Han Solo","Kylo Ren -RELATED_TO-> light","Kylo Ren -RELATED_TO-> Anakin Skywalker","Kylo Ren -RELATED_TO-> Bail Organa"]}
