In the video , future Ted is heard saying , `` ... When I think how lucky I am to wake up next to your mom every morning , I ca n't help but be amazed how easy it all really was ... '' , indirectly stating that The Mother is alive . The video ends right after the train passes at Farhampton station and credits start rolling , implying that Ted never went back to Robin as he lived a successful married life with Tracy Mosby . Contents ( hide ) 1 Casting 2 Character history 2.1 Name 3 Death 4 Notes 5 References Casting ( edit ) During its first eight seasons , the successful sitcom How I Met Your Mother often hinted at the unseen character of The Mother . Well - known actresses often made guest appearances on the show . Many fans expected that another would play one of the most - wanted roles in Hollywood , but creators Carter Bays and Craig Thomas wanted an unknown .","entities":["Craig Thomas","Ted","The Mother","Farhampton station","Carter Bays","How I Met Your Mother","Robin","Hollywood"],"facts":["Craig Thomas -RELATED_TO-> Tracy McConnell","Ted -LOCATED_IN-> club","Ted -LOCATED_IN-> Cindy and the Mother's apartment","Ted -LOCATED_IN-> subway","Ted -LOCATED_IN-> bar"]}
