She is currently inactive due to her maternity leave . After spending years modeling , including winning Miss Hawaiian Tropic Canada in 2003 , Ouellet was hired by the professional wrestling promotion WWE in August 2006 , after she participated in the WWE Diva Search competition . She spent time in Ohio Valley Wrestling and Florida Championship Wrestling , WWE 's developmental territories , before being assigned to the SmackDown brand in 2008 . In December 2008 , Maryse won her first WWE Divas Championship and held it for seven months , which is the third longest reign in the championship 's history . In April 2009 , she was drafted to the Raw brand , and won the WWE Divas Championship for the second time in February 2010 , making her the first wrestler to have held the championship on more than one occasion . In mid-2010 , she became the co-host of NXT and the manager of Ted DiBiase , prior to her release from the company in October 2011 . In April 2016 , she returned to the company and became the manager of her husband The Miz , managing him to three Intercontinental Championship reigns .","entities":["WWE","Miss Hawaiian Tropic Canada","WWE Diva Search","Florida Championship Wrestling","Maryse's release from WWE","Ohio Valley Wrestling","Raw","WWE Divas Championship","Ted DiBiase","NXT","The Miz","Intercontinental Championship","Maryse Ouellet","SmackDown"],"facts":["WWE -RELATED_TO-> WWE RAW REPORT: WHO IS THE NUMBER ONE CONTENDER?, WHO DID NOT MAKE THEIR DEBUT FROM NXT TONIGHT?, A CELEBRATION OF WOMEN'S WRESTLING ... AND A WALK OUT, AND MORE","WWE -RELATED_TO-> WWE SMACKDOWN REPORT: OWENS AND JERICHO VERSUS STYLES AND CESARO, CORBIN TALKS, REIGNS AND STYLES FACE OFF, VAUDEVILLAINS DEBUT, AND MORE","WWE -RELATED_TO-> WWE SMACKDOWN RESULTS -- 4 / 14 / 16 ( SAMI ZAYN VS . CHRIS JERICHO IN MAIN EVENT , NO . 1 CONTENDERS TAG TEAM TOURNAMENT CONTINUES )","WWE -RELATED_TO-> WWE RAW REPORT: WILL THE MAIN EVENT OF BATTLEGROUND CHANGE?, SOME RETURNS TO ACTION, BECKY USES