The show and its episodes attained high ratings on IMDb , around 8 / 10 . BROADCAST ( edit ) Internationally , the series was acquired in Australia by the Seven Network and premiered on 24 August 2016 . In the United States , PBS began airing the show , retitled as The Durrells in Corfu , on 16 October 2016 at 8pm . The Durrells started screening in New Zealand on 26 October 2016 on Prime TV . In Canada , the Canadian Broadcasting Corporation began airing Series 1 on 13 September 2017 . In Spain , the series has been acquired by the streaming platform Filmin . A third series of The Durrells was announced by writer Simon Nye at the BFI and Radio Times Television Festival on 8 April 2017 . It began filming in May 2017 and is expected to air on ITV in the Spring of 2018 .","entities":["New Zealand","United States","PBS","Australia","Spain","The Durrells","Simon Nye","Prime TV","Canadian Broadcasting Corporation","Filmin","BFI","Radio Times Television Festival","Seven Network","ITV","Canada"],"facts":["New Zealand -LOCATED_IN-> Oceania","two-way contacts between California and New Zealand -LOCATED_IN-> New Zealand","90-minute two-way contact between New Zealand and England -LOCATED_IN-> New Zealand","Discovery of islands -LOCATED_IN-> New Zealand","New Zealand -LOCATED_IN-> Southwest Pacific"]}
