On May 2 , 2010 , Meet the Press became the last NBC News program to convert to high definition , and unveiled a new set consisting of large video screens mostly used to display Washington scenery , satellite interview subjects and moderator and subject talking points , along with graphics produced for the format . Moderators ( edit ) The following is the list of moderators for Meet the Press : Martha Rountree 1947 -- 1953 Ned Brooks 1953 -- 1965 Lawrence E. Spivak 1966 -- 1975 Bill Monroe 1975 -- 1984 Roger Mudd and Marvin Kalb ( co-moderators ) 1984 -- 1985 Marvin Kalb 1985 -- 1987 Chris Wallace 1987 -- 1988 Garrick Utley 1989 -- 1991 Tim Russert 1991 -- 2008 Tom Brokaw 2008 David Gregory 2008 -- 2014 Chuck Todd 2014 -- present On - remote broadcasts ( outside D.C. studios ) ( edit ) Date Location Event / Reason July 17 , 1988 Atlanta , Georgia 1988 Democratic National Convention August 14 , 1988 New Orleans ,","entities":["Bill Monroe","New Orleans","Atlanta","Martha Rountree","Lawrence E. Spivak","Ned Brooks","Roger Mudd","Marvin Kalb","Chris Wallace","Garrick Utley","Tim Russert","Tom Brokaw","David Gregory","NBC News","Chuck Todd"],"facts":["Bill Monroe -RELATED_TO-> Mandolin","Bill Monroe -RELATED_TO-> In the Pines","Bill Monroe -CREATED-> In the Pines (1941 recording)","Bill Monroe -CREATED-> In the Pines (1952 recording)","New Orleans -LOCATED_IN-> United States"]}
